---
layout: default
---
{%- assign profiles = site.data.profiles -%}
<div class="hn-page home">
  <section class="hero reveal" aria-labelledby="hero-name">
    <div class="hero-text">
      {% if page.eyebrow %}
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ page.eyebrow }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      <h1 id="hero-name" class="hero-name"><span class="hero-first">{{ site.first_name }}</span> <span class="hero-last">{{ site.last_name }}</span></h1>
      <ul class="hero-roles">
        {% for role in page.roles %}
          <li>
            <strong>{{ role.title }}</strong> ·
            {% if role.url -%}
              <a href="{{ role.url }}">{{ role.org }}</a>
            {%- else -%}
              {{ role.org }}
            {%- endif %}
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="hero-bio">{{ content }}</div>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="mailto:{{ profiles.email }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i> Email me</a>
        <div class="icon-links" role="list" aria-label="Academic profiles">
          {% for link in profiles.links %}
            <a class="icon-link" role="listitem" href="{{ link.url }}" title="{{ link.label }}" aria-label="{{ link.label }}"><i class="{{ link.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-photo">
      <picture>
        <source srcset="{{ '/assets/img/prof_pic.webp' | relative_url }}" type="image/webp">
        <img
          src="{{ '/assets/img/prof_pic.jpg' | relative_url }}"
          alt="Portrait of {{ site.first_name }} {{ site.last_name }}"
          width="360"
          height="360"
          fetchpriority="high"
        >
      </picture>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="section home-research reveal" aria-labelledby="areas-heading">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="areas-heading" class="section-title">Research areas</h2>
      <a class="section-link" href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}">
        Explore research <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="home-research-overview">
      {% include research-map-overview.liquid id='home' %}

      <div class="home-research-copy">
        <p>{{ page.research_intro }}</p>
        <p>
          Across these areas, I focus on formulations and algorithms that retain physical
          fidelity and mathematical guarantees while remaining useful on realistic systems.
          The overlaps show where a methods contribution and an application question meet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-pillar-grid">
      <article class="home-pillar home-pillar--optimization">
        <header class="home-pillar__head">
          <span class="home-pillar__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i></span>
          <h3><a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#global">Optimization &amp; Machine Learning</a></h3>
        </header>
        <p>
          Mathematical programming and global optimization algorithms for nonconvex programs
          form the methodological core. Learning-accelerated strategies and open-source software
          target repeatedly solved parametric problems, reducing solution times while retaining
          optimality guarantees. This work also includes optimization under uncertainty for
          power-system applications.
        </p>
        <nav class="home-pillar__links" aria-label="Optimization and machine learning topics">
          <a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#global">Global optimization</a>
          <a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#uncertainty">Under uncertainty</a>
          <a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#learning">Learning for optimization</a>
        </nav>
      </article>

      <article class="home-pillar home-pillar--power">
        <header class="home-pillar__head">
          <span class="home-pillar__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="home-pillar__svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
              <path d="M10 3h4l4 18H6L10 3Z"></path>
              <path d="M8.7 9h6.6M7.8 13h8.4M7 17h10M10 3 7.7 7h8.6L14 3"></path>
              <path d="M2 7h5.7M16.3 7H22"></path>
              <circle cx="2" cy="7" r="1"></circle>
              <circle cx="22" cy="7" r="1"></circle>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3><a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#uncertainty">Power Systems Optimization</a></h3>
        </header>
        <p>
          AC optimal power flow and related discrete variants, including unit commitment and
          transmission switching, under uncertainty from renewable generation. Resilience work
          spans microgrid design, reconfiguration, and black-start restoration.
        </p>
        <nav class="home-pillar__links" aria-label="Power systems optimization topics">
          <a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#uncertainty">Planning &amp; operations</a>
          <a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#resilience">Grid resilience</a>
        </nav>
      </article>

      <article class="home-pillar home-pillar--networks">
        <header class="home-pillar__head">
          <span class="home-pillar__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project"></i></span>
          <h3><a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#networks">Networks &amp; Control</a></h3>
        </header>
        <p>
          Optimization and spectral graph methods for robust network and topology design,
          with applications to disturbance propagation, robot localization, and UAV
          communication networks.
        </p>
        <nav class="home-pillar__links" aria-label="Networks, control, and robotics topics">
          <a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#networks">Networks, Control &amp; Robotics</a>
        </nav>
      </article>

      <article class="home-pillar home-pillar--quantum">
        <header class="home-pillar__head">
          <span class="home-pillar__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            {% include research-area-icon.liquid kind='quantum-circuit' class='home-pillar__svg' %}
          </span>
          <h3><a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#quantum">Quantum Computing</a></h3>
        </header>
        <p>
          Optimization methods for provably optimal quantum circuit design, efficient
          hardware-aware encodings for constrained optimization problems, and hybrid
          quantum–classical approaches that accelerate classical optimization algorithms.
        </p>
        <nav class="home-pillar__links" aria-label="Quantum computing topics">
          <a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}#quantum">Quantum Computing</a>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section home-split reveal">
    <div class="updates">
      <h2 id="updates-heading" class="section-title">Recent updates</h2>
      <ol class="update-list" aria-labelledby="updates-heading">
        {% for item in site.data.updates limit: page.updates_limit %}
          <li class="update-item">
            <span class="update-date">{{ item.date }}</span>
            <span class="update-text">{{ item.text | markdownify | remove: '<p>' | remove: '</p>' | strip }}</span>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
    <aside class="contact-card" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <h2 id="contact-heading" class="section-title">Contact</h2>
      <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:{{ profiles.email }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ profiles.email }}</a>
      <ul class="profile-list">
        {% for link in profiles.links %}
          <li>
            <a href="{{ link.url }}"><i class="{{ link.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ link.label }}</a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </section>
</div>

{% include research-map-assets.liquid %}
<script defer src="{{ '/assets/js/site.js' | relative_url | bust_file_cache }}"></script>
